IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MEGASCALE-PINGPONG.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-NODES           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 ACTIVE-EXPERTS      PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 COMM-HIDDEN-PCT     PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 BOOST-RATIO-X100    PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-MEGASCALE.
    IF NUM-NODES == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 76 TO COMM-HIDDEN-PCT.
    COMPUTE BOOST-RATIO-X100 = 100 + (ACTIVE-EXPERTS * 90 / 8).

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 BOOST-RATIO-X100.
    WEIGHT 30 COMM-HIDDEN-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
